<link rel="stylesheet" href="/tools/simple-page.css?v=20260531">

<div class="account-form-page">
	<section class="account-form-hero">
		<span>Account Security</span>
		<h1>Change Password</h1>
		<p>Escribe tu password actual y confirma el nuevo password dos veces para proteger tu cuenta.</p>
	</section>

	<form action="{{ getLink('account/password') }}" method="post" class="account-form-card">
		<div class="account-form-card-heading">
			<span>Password</span>
			<h2>Actualizar password</h2>
			<p>Usa una combinacion segura de letras y numeros.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="account-form-fields">
			<label>
				<span>New Password</span>
				<input type="password" name="newpassword" maxlength="29" autofocus>
			</label>
			<label>
				<span>New Password Again</span>
				<input type="password" name="newpassword2" maxlength="29">
			</label>
			<label>
				<span>Current Password</span>
				<input type="password" name="oldpassword" maxlength="29">
			</label>
		</div>

		<div class="account-form-actions">
			<button class="account-form-button account-form-button-green" type="submit">Submit</button>
			<a class="account-form-button account-form-button-blue" href="{{ getLink('account/manage') }}">Back</a>
		</div>
	</form>
</div>
